  "evidence": [
    "Fresh verified master41a11dcce application build-a0ujryx4 supplies actual Release commands and physical objects. Pinned Midi set_fname4C7CF0 and set_switch_type4C77D0 use EBP arguments; current frame-omitted objects miss. Midi_Device init4C57A0 and Wave_In_Device init4C5A10 use EBP window/backend arguments; create_device4C56D0/4C59A0 likewise read frame arguments.",
    "Sound-loader init_sound_timer4C5FB0, create wrapper4C6000 and delete wrapper4C6030 also use EBP arguments. Historical load_sound_dll4C5E50 /Oy- trial was negative and is not erased: observe the complete owner and do not adopt a profile that loses an existing exact body or worsens supported semantics. A failed bounded trial is retained evidence, not permission for a spelling sweep.",
    "Production C++ and annotations remain unchanged; these CPP files authorize private diagnostic controls only. For each owner, calibrate the exact current Release parse/runtime/define/include and compiler recipe against its actual object, require a physically identical private replica, prove a deliberate one-body damage is detected, then screen only /Oy-. Four compiler attempts per owner, with independent leased prefixes and a frozen source epoch.",
    "Observe all mapped owner functions. Require no existing actual owner match loss, scoped strict original code/reference checks for gains, full physical inventory and review of every changed unscoped helper plus selected linked winners in their own contexts. Same source, a MAP winner label or an increased score does not prove retention/selection or preservation. Unknown EH, mismatches and residual failures remain explicit and unwaived.",
    "Adopt only independently reviewed source-specific CMake options justified by controls and pinned frames. No global/default, /Ob, linker or measurement-profile changes, new byte claims, historical demotions or baseline resets. Require focused regressions, source/claim/reference continuity, fresh build/link, relevant original/helper checks, coordinator manual review and destination recheck. Manual integration is not automatic/full-game acceptance."
  ],
